Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally obtained the disc\Nthat contains Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,is it possible she defeated that incumbent\Nguard and took the disc all by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get my dad's\Ndisc out of this prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and that includes the one\NPalesnake's holding on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I erased all knowledge of myself from\NMirachan's memory disc, an obvious choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And therefore, nobody can reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The true difference between a\Nhuman and an animal is nothing less
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,than whether or not they desire\Nto go to heaven after they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,People should live their lives in such a\Nmanner that they'll be led into heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For that is the beauty inherent\Nin the nature of humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3. Come and find a way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out without me, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,keep up but long guy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use the phone now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.10,0:02:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that gun out of my\Nface or I'll beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:03:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit down so your\Nfeet don't get tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, here's a\Ncold can of cola for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come again any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Speedwagon Foundation\Nheadquarters in Dallas, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be advised, we don't\Naccept collect calls on this line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I looked in the phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an inmate incarcerated at the\NGreen Dolphin Street prison in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And my name is Jolene Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please connect me to somebody\Nwho knows what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the daughter of Professor\NJotaro Kujo? And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a Foundation representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:04:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, so you know, I'm not a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you clearly know\Nabout stands, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to know\Nanything about discs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo's body was retrieved from the\NUUV. He wasn't transferred here to Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, rest assured, his body\Nis being sheltered in a safe area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's really rather\Nunfortunate, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are, well, no signs\Nof life, medically speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you believe me\Nthat he could be revived?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm merely a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've obtained one disc. I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that my father will\Ndefinitely regenerate with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to give the Foundation\Nthis disc by any means necessary,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.26,0:04:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to come up with an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get the disc out of this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:05:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, miss, but isn't this\Ncall being recorded by the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm fully aware\Nof that possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have no time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's extremely urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in an unbelievably\Ndangerous situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.32,0:05:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't safely hide the disc anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way for this to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, though, I'm\Nnot allowed to have any visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You talking about the one sandwiched\Nbetween the women's and men's prisons?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can meet us there in 20\Nminutes, I think I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get there in 20 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,From right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's urgent, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want us to collect the disk,\Nwe will do so with the utmost effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say he'll be revived,\Nthen we believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you must understand that we are an\Nunarmed chemotherapy research association.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the Speedwagon Foundation\Ncannot help you escape
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,from the prison or\Nprotect you from any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Still willing to take the risk\Nand come to the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how exactly do I get it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't discuss that\Nmatter over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can say is, please\Nlook for Savage Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll make sense there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we call this\NOperation Savage Guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Savage Guardian?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta head to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From Floor One's cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to get to the courtyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,first I have to go through that\Ngate, then walk upstairs in the back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and finally, cross over\Nthe connecting corridor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,on the second floor into the medical wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go through. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're FE40536.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:06:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the nuisance who was\Nsent to the punishment cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're restricted from accessing\Ncertain parts of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch the baseball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let anyone see me. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Emporio, who are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry, they're not enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd prefer to sleep in a bed, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately for him, there simply\Nisn't one to be found in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.82,0:08:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So naturally, he's got no other choice\Nbut to sleep in the grand piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, this spot is the\Nghost room I call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the place where I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of us are ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're both actual living humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a body temperature and a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like this room\Nis inhabited by a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, the room is a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.18,0:08:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.10,0:08:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you understand if I\Nsay they're ghost objects?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Green Dolphin Street\NPrison caught fire
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.26,0:08:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,in 1984 and then underwent\Na huge renovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This room was one part of the\Nprison which completely burned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're inside objects of the past,\Nthe ghost of the music room itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporia, wouldn't this\Nmean that you're a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that you are a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born like this, with the\Nability to use these ghost objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Interacting with them is my stand power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, they're the\Nonly things I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, for example, even this chocolate\Nbar and Florida orange juice...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't actually eat either of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can taste them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That little clock got stopped\Nwhen the prison was burnt down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.16,0:09:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There is still time until\Nthat meeting in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're discussing how to sneak the\Ndisc out of this prison over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you be so dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that you're\Nin a difficult situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but Pale Snake is definitely going\Nto learn about your scheme now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then please, Emporio, I need you to tell\Nme a shortcut to get me to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't misunderstand me, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not as if this\Nghost room is connected
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.98,0:09:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,everywhere all throughout\Nthe prison complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:10:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just employing the ghost items\Nwhich I can use my stand power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to interact with in order to move\Naround without getting caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, I know we have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to tag along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a good idea to let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.80,0:10:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be a great help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to mention, his\Nname is Weather Forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the present-day music room?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can let your guard\Ndown with Weather Forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason why he doesn't talk much\Nis because he lost his memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.78,0:10:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any\Nmemory of his childhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,or even how he ended up\Ninside of the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But he has to serve a\Nsentence of six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He likes to stretch out\Nand walk on his toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He loves reading TV guides,\Nbut he doesn't watch TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever he does speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,he doesn't open his mouth very wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so he tends to talk right\Nin front of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and his nose breath is warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.88,0:10:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so does this mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail, snake, stole weather\Nforecast, memories, probably so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,because of this he wants to\Nfind out who he really is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.78,0:11:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Also weather forecast\Nwants to help figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,why your father's memory\Ndisk was stolen from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he isn't the\Nsort of stand user who
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,has been created with a\Ndisk so it sounds like!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast was born.\NA stand user his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...is to alter and control\Nweather phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's named...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...Weather Forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just act like you didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, seems someone was surprised by\Nthe sound and looked inside of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to confirm this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that there's somebody\Nwho knows you're making a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And they've come here to check up on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I've seen the enemy's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.46,0:12:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea he was already\Nthis close to us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that guy is a stand user,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,then we're going to have to take\Ncare of him right now, this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better to hide from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on running!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know that you're trying to\Nmake your way over to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.98,0:13:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,he only came to find us because he must not\Nknow what you talked about on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If he knew what your plan was, then you\Nwould have headed directly to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he's chasing after us right\Nnow instead of trying to beat us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.20,0:13:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've gotta turn that corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry before it catches up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, hiding was a really good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That weird man doesn't seem to have any\Nclue about where it is you're heading to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.80,0:13:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell was going\Non with that guy anyways?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The way he ran on all\Nfours was so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We were pretty lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing the dude was still\Nslower than us regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:14:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you should make your way over to\Nthat courtyard as soon as you possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The phone call you made to the Speedwagon\NFoundation was definitely recorded,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but I get the feeling Palesnake\Nhasn't actually heard that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Quicker you go, less dangerous it'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Medical wing's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you make your way\Npast the medical wing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a gate for the\Ncorridor around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It leads towards the factory\Nand then to the men's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,prison across the courtyard\Nyou're trying to reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Both the men and women\Nprisoners can access the medical
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,wing and given that Weather\Nforecast is a guy if he tells the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,guards on duty that he's\Ngoing back To the men's prison
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and he can definitely go to the\Nfactory entrance Through the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,corridor or at least that's what\Nhe said to me you first okay
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan and I just\Nneed to bribe the guards right
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,50 bucks enough Sure but tell\Nthem that you need to repair
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,your boots at the factory no\NMatter what though even if you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,were able to go through the\Nmedical wing of the Prison you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,have to get into the courtyard\Nby force security is light
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but If you get caught they\Ncan shoot at you you'll get
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,yourself another five years For\Nprison breaking you think I have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To force my way in, guess I'll\Njust have to roll with it. I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,have no choice besides what's\Nan Additional five years to my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,prison sentence it's essentially\Nnothing you Know thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,for all your help Emporio sure\Nbut I can't go further please
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want your father to come back\Nto life, back to consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,because if he does so,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,then I think we can start to see\Nsome hope in our world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! Aw, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is up with this can of cola?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You just touched my drink, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you shake or touch this\Ncan when I wasn't looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you better go get\Nme a new one now, inmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As if.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.77,0:15:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No way I'd touch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I touched was\Nyour little saucer plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My right shoe has a big\Nold hole in its heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:15:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit of a safety hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd really like to get\Nit repaired at the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I spilled my cola because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So where's that damn towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,are you seriously telling me I need to\Ngo buy you another can of soda right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I need to pour\Nit in your cup for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you do this on your...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I'm looking for, a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go now, but you have to\Nbe back here within 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:16:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:16:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's already gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.40,0:17:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec, where's my cup and saucer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it really be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.64,0:17:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The card saucer is floating in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The cup and my boots, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, the cola\Nisn't splashing everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's floating balls of liquid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single thing I touch inexplicably\Nbecomes unmoored, suspended in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this $50 bill floated itself\Nstraight out of the guard's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And even myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did all of this weird stuff begin when\Nthat strange guy started to chase after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,During his pursuit, he spit\Nsome sort of substance at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it fell out\Nbecause my body flipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I control my thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any sense of direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Up or down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no gravity here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be in a zero-gravity\Nzone. Going to the men's prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then proceed ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy he's gonna take the desk\Nbecause I put my full strength into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my balance
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta focus on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in one direction like a rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn it, stupid disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It bounces back into shape,\Nlike some type of rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's probably the reason why Palesnake
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,instructed me to just\Ncollect the disc for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.64,0:18:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go any further away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being attacked again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My voice doesn't reach him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, somebody got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I was, thinking that I was\Nonly going to have to kill that woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Cujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for Jumpin' Jack Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand power is gravity removal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't touch whatever\Nit is he shoots at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to dodge it, or else\Nyou'll become weightless!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero gravity zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly are a stand user, then you\Nshould be fully aware what it is this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you think you can figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What you've just thrown at me\Nlooks like a piece of garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This weather forecast guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,he's apparently very powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but his ability to control the\Nweather is still a mystery to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That cloud cover he summoned is probably\Nworking as an atmospheric layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He simply reflected away our\Nenemies attack with that resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And that man's arm spin\Nhas centrifugal force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it's weightless, he can accelerate\Nforever with that spinning force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would mean, since the\Ncore of his body stays still,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,he can accurately aim with strong power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Jack Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did this fire come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Air resistance friction?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is seriously not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spreading all over my body now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:21:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Release the zero gravity!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.06,0:21:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The abnormality alarm has\Nbeen activated in Hallway 7B.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.12,0:21:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, the abnormality\Nalarm... Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been the impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've retrieved the damn disk and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate is closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.24,0:21:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting even harder\Nto go to the courtyard now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy will be trapped in here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my chance to get the disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.26,0:21:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that you touch,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'm right, it becomes weightless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Cujoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.58,0:22:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The courtyard is just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Still though, where is that\Nanti-gravity-wielding thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.72,0:22:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get the disc back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.72,0:22:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.98,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.90,0:24:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
